WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.592
Rabbit fell into a bush.

2
00:00:06.593 --> 00:00:10.422
His ears got caught, and he tried to wiggle free.

3
00:00:10.423 --> 00:00:13.855
But he was stuck!

4
00:00:13.856 --> 00:00:17.485
Hours went by.

5
00:00:17.486 --> 00:00:21.143
Rabbit was still trapped in the bush.

6
00:00:21.144 --> 00:00:24.225
"Henry will come home soon," he thought.

7
00:00:24.226 --> 00:00:27.730
"He'll find me here."

8
00:00:27.731 --> 00:00:32.064
At last Henry was home!

9
00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:35.187
"I'm right here, Henry!" Rabbit called.

10
00:00:35.188 --> 00:00:37.644
"Please find me!"

11
00:00:37.645 --> 00:00:41.480
But Henry went right past Rabbit.

12
00:00:41.481 --> 00:00:45.724
Rabbit sighed as Henry ran inside the house.

13
00:00:45.725 --> 00:00:49.265
"Maybe he'll come out again later," he thought.

14
00:00:49.266 --> 00:00:52.549
By now the afternoon air was chilly.

15
00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:56.908
Leaves swirled around the bush.

16
00:00:56.909 --> 00:00:59.214
Rabbit shivered.

17
00:00:59.215 --> 00:01:02.510
"Where's Henry?" he thought.

18
00:01:02.511 --> 00:01:06.992
Just then the whole family came into the yard. They

19
00:01:06.993 --> 00:01:10.450
were holding rakes and other things. "I'll

20
00:01:10.451 --> 00:01:16.597
rake up all these leaves!" Henry yelled. "Let's

21
00:01:16.598 --> 00:01:21.801
make a big pile!" Everyone

22
00:01:21.802 --> 00:01:30.290
started to rake up leaves. "I'm

23
00:01:30.291 --> 00:01:33.932
over here, Henry!" Rabbit yelled. "I'm

24
00:01:33.933 --> 00:01:37.147
stuck in this bush!" Henry

25
00:01:37.148 --> 00:01:39.017
looked up. Rrr!

26
00:01:39.018 --> 00:01:43.182
Rrr! Roar! Suddenly

27
00:01:43.183 --> 00:01:47.900
a loud blowing machine started up. Dad

28
00:01:47.901 --> 00:01:51.129
came closer, blowing away leaves. The

29
00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:57.050
blowing machine sent leaves flying everywhere. "Oh

30
00:01:57.051 --> 00:02:01.437
no!" Rabbit thought as the bush shook hard. Then—

31
00:02:01.438 --> 00:02:03.239
whoosh!

32
00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:06.038
Rabbit flew out of the bush.

33
00:02:06.039 --> 00:02:09.174
He tumbled into a pile of leaves.

34
00:02:09.175 --> 00:02:11.988
More leaves fell on top of him.

35
00:02:11.989 --> 00:02:15.131
"Help!" Rabbit cried.

36
00:02:15.132 --> 00:02:19.942
But no one heard him.

